 {"id":"fabro-9967","title":"Planner prompt: cap sd ready to a top-N view and pass created_since to fabro_runs_list","status":"closed","type":"task","priority":2,"createdAt":"2026-09-09T15:30:01.314Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-09T15:42:21.005Z","description":"Run 01M23B02H3ZNND8AT2D3Y2S4SG seq 32: `sd ready --assignee fabro --limit 200` returned 189 issues / 25,613 bytes to pick one candidate; seq 41: `fabro_runs_list` returned 12,676 bytes / 14 runs where only status, PR state, and goal matter for the in-flight guard. Change the command table in `.fabro/workflows/develop/prompts/planner.md` to use `--limit 10` for `sd ready` and pass a recency filter to `fabro_runs_list` (in-flight runs are recent by definition). Expected effect: ~35KB less context in the planner's early turns, faster first output, less tie-break distraction. Basis: run 01M23B02H3ZNND8AT2D3Y2S4SG, workflow version 3bd915204178a8e5fd6796670d1bbfae4248a4b01f5d0fb7201e53b394cfdda8, commit db6b8ca5b4f7c0fc7583e1d28df1fa9ba295958e","labels":["revision"],"closedAt":"2026-09-09T15:42:21.005Z","closeReason":"Duplicate of fabro-c3b4 (sd ready top-N firehose); the incremental created_since bit merged into fabro-c3b4's scope 2026-09-09."}
 {"id":"fabro-b769","title":"Add a long-stage heartbeat notification for run visibility","status":"open","type":"task","priority":2,"createdAt":"2026-09-09T15:30:01.376Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-09T15:42:20.763Z","description":"Slack notifications in `.fabro/workflows/develop/workflow.toml` are configured only for run.completed/run.failed; in run 01M23B02H3ZNND8AT2D3Y2S4SG the implementer ran 15 of the run's 19 minutes with no external signal and no operator hook to cancel (run settings, cost concentration). Change the notifications block to add a stage-level event or a \"stage exceeds N minutes\" heartbeat alongside the terminal events. Expected effect: mid-run visibility into single-stage cost concentration while intervention is still possible. Basis: run 01M23B02H3ZNND8AT2D3Y2S4SG, workflow version 3bd915204178a8e5fd6796670d1bbfae4248a4b01f5d0fb7201e53b394cfdda8, commit db6b8ca5b4f7c0fc7583e1d28df1fa9ba295958e","labels":["revision"],"assignee":"fabro"}
