 {"id":"fabro-0586","title":"Add an available-binaries line to develop PROJECT_FACTS","status":"open","type":"task","priority":2,"createdAt":"2026-09-09T16:50:01.248Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-09T17:02:33.350Z","description":"In .fabro/workflows/develop/prompts/project-facts.md, add one line stating which shell binaries the run toolchain provides (rg, sd, ml, just, nu — no fd). Evidence: in run 01M23EDVNHPGD8QNBWZN8WNTDD the planner lost a call to fd: command not found (event 46) and the implementer guessed a wrong crate directory before finding lib/components/ (event 99). The crate-to-path-map half of that finding is already open seed fabro-3d2d; this seed covers only the tool-availability line. Expected effect: removes binary-probing calls in planner and implementer on every run. Basis: run 01M23EDVNHPGD8QNBWZN8WNTDD, workflow version 70cee3b32d01c25022b0c84ba4b42f2e8c93d679f400542db4ca1cafafa1a6c1, commit 1bd14a4d41278a40a3615a61ffe55368fe0959e2","labels":["revision"],"assignee":"fabro"}
 {"id":"fabro-6b58","title":"Bound the planner in-flight check: created_since window plus explicit self-exclusion","status":"open","type":"task","priority":2,"createdAt":"2026-09-09T17:13:54.681Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-09T17:13:54.681Z","description":"In .fabro/workflows/develop/prompts/planner.md step 4 (IN-FLIGHT PR CHECK): call fabro_runs_list with created_since ≈ 48 h, and add one line telling the planner to exclude this run's own id (from its preamble header) from the in-flight set. Grounded in run 01M23HWFFSB9NK78PGSCZWE6MA: the unbounded call (event seq 41) returned 16 runs / 14,492 bytes — 15 terminal with identical generic goal text — and the planner had to deduce 'the only non-terminal run is this run itself'. Verified regression: closed seed fabro-9967 mandated created_since but the current prompt text carries no such bound. Expected effect: tool output drops ~14.5 KB to ≤2 KB per run and the self-run confusion class disappears. Basis: run 01M23HWFFSB9NK78PGSCZWE6MA, workflow version 70cee3b32d01c25022b0c84ba4b42f2e8c93d679f400542db4ca1cafafa1a6c1, commit 515758e102a81c1c35d8c41bb3fd96209f1f04e9","labels":["revision"]}
